-v1","level":"senior","word":"adhesive","sort_order":1,"sense":"黏性的","alt_zh":"高中生用透明膠帶仔細黏合紙模型裂開的接縫。","example":"The adhesive tape held the torn paper model together.","example_zh":"膠帶把撕裂的紙模型黏在一起。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/adhesive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-adolescence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"adolescence","sort_order":1,"sense":"青春期","alt_zh":"穿整齊校服的高中生在桌前安排作業與照顧盆栽等日常任務。","example":"During adolescence, Leo learned to balance schoolwork with new responsibilities.","example_zh":"青春期時，里歐學著平衡課業與新的責任。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/adolescence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-adversary-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"adversary","sort_order":1,"sense":"對手","alt_zh":"兩名高中棋手在對局後禮貌握手，棋盤放在兩人之間。","example":"Even after the match, the chess player treated her adversary with respect.","example_zh":"即使比賽結束，棋手仍尊重自己的對手。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/adversary-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-affirmative-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"affirmative","sort_order":1,"sense":"肯定的","alt_zh":"教練微笑點頭並豎起拇指，高中隊員準備開始練習。","example":"The coach gave an affirmative nod when we asked to begin practice.","example_zh":"我們詢問能否開始練習時，教練肯定地點了點頭。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/affirmative-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-affluent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"affluent","sort_order":1,"sense":"富裕的","alt_zh":"衣著整齊的家庭把新的小提琴與長笛交給社區老師，學生開心圍觀。","example":"The affluent family donated new instruments to the community music room.","example_zh":"富裕的家庭捐贈新樂器給社區音樂教室。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/affluent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-aggression-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"aggression","sort_order":1,"sense":"侵略；攻擊行為","alt_zh":"裁判伸手阻止兩名成年球員爭執推擠，其他人退後保持距離，無傷害畫面。","example":"The referee stopped the game when the player's aggression became unsafe.","example_zh":"球員的攻擊行為變得危險時，裁判停止了比賽。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/aggression-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-agile-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"agile","sort_order":1,"sense":"敏捷的","alt_zh":"一隻敏捷的貓輕巧跳上庭院低牆旁的小平台。","example":"The agile cat jumped neatly from the wall onto a narrow ledge.","example_zh":"敏捷的貓俐落地從牆上跳到狹窄的平台。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/agile-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-ailment-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"ailment","sort_order":1,"sense":"疾病","alt_zh":"高中生在保健室拿著面紙，護理師溫和詢問，氣氛平靜。","example":"The nurse asked about the minor ailment that had kept him home.","example_zh":"護理師詢問是什麼小毛病讓他留在家裡休息。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/ailment-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-allegory-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"allegory","sort_order":1,"sense":"寓言","alt_zh":"故事書插畫場景中，狐狸、兔子與鹿合作從水井提水，畫面無文字。","example":"The story of animals sharing a well is an allegory about cooperation.","example_zh":"動物共用水井的故事，是一則談合作的寓言。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/allegory-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-alleviation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"alleviation","sort_order":1,"sense":"減輕","alt_zh":"高中健行隊走