鏡查看茂盛綠葉中唯一一片蒼白葉片。","example":"One unusually pale leaf was an anomaly among the healthy green leaves.","example_zh":"健康綠葉之中，一片異常蒼白的葉子格外不同。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/anomaly-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-anthem-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"anthem","sort_order":1,"sense":"國歌","alt_zh":"高中合唱團站在禮堂，跟隨指揮莊重歌唱，無旗幟與文字。","example":"The school choir rehearsed the anthem before the ceremony.","example_zh":"學校合唱團在典禮前排練國歌。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/anthem-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-anthropology-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"anthropology","sort_order":1,"sense":"人類學","alt_zh":"高中生在博物館觀察不同時代家庭生活與工具的模型展示。","example":"The anthropology exhibit explored how families lived in different societies.","example_zh":"人類學展覽探討不同社會的家庭如何生活。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/anthropology-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-antibody-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"antibody","sort_order":1,"sense":"抗體","alt_zh":"科學教室裡，高中生把Y形抗體模型接到表面形狀吻合的病菌模型。","example":"The model showed an antibody attaching to a matching part of a germ.","example_zh":"模型展示抗體如何附著在病菌相對應的部位。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/antibody-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-antiquity-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"antiquity","sort_order":1,"sense":"古代","alt_zh":"高中生在博物館仔細觀察玻璃櫃中保存完好的古老陶油燈。","example":"The clay lamp from antiquity was displayed in a protective glass case.","example_zh":"這盞古代陶燈展示在保護玻璃櫃內。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/antiquity-01-v1.webp","