ing it.","example_zh":"修復師清潔畫作前，先評估它的保存狀況。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/appraisal-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-apprehensive-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"apprehensive","sort_order":1,"sense":"憂慮的","alt_zh":"高中提琴手站在舞台側邊，緊握琴弓、神情緊張，老師溫柔鼓勵。","example":"Nora felt apprehensive before stepping onto the stage for her first solo.","example_zh":"第一次獨奏上台前，諾拉感到忐忑。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/apprehensive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-apprentice-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"apprentice","sort_order":1,"sense":"學徒","alt_zh":"年輕成年學徒戴護目鏡，專心看木匠示範安全操作固定好的木料。","example":"The apprentice watched the carpenter carefully before trying the tool.","example_zh":"學徒在試用工具前，仔細觀察木匠的動作。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/apprentice-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-aquatic-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"aquatic","sort_order":1,"sense":"水生的","alt_zh":"清澈池塘裡可見水草、小魚、螺與青蛙，岸邊高中生觀察。","example":"The pond supports many aquatic plants and animals.","example_zh":"這座池塘養育許多水生植物與動物。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/aquatic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-archive-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"archive","sort_order":1,"sense":"檔案","alt_zh":"檔案管理員在整齊檔案庫裡，向高中生展示戴手套取出的老照片。","example":"The old photographs were stored in the town's historical archive.","example_zh":"老照片保存在城鎮的歷史檔案庫裡。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/archive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-arduous-01-v1","level":"seni